	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그리고 걱정거리도 전부\n잊어버리는 거야!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"반 전체가 함께 왔으니까,\n여행하는 동안에는 모두 같은\n목적을 공유해야 한다고 생각해!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = None
	"좋은 생각이야!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Luna
	"스바루, 새로운 목적은\n네가 정하는 게 어때!?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Geo
	"…어?\n내-내가 정한다고!?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Bud
	"난 스바루를 믿어!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"오늘과 내일은\n네가 정한 목적에\n따라 지내는 거야!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Zack
	"할 수 있어!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Geo
	"으음…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그럼…\n‘잊지 못할 여행’은 어때?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Luna
	"오, 좋은데?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MrShepar
	"그럼 5-A반의 목적은\n‘잊지 못할\n여행’으로 정하자!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = None
	"야호!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
